# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Development (Optional)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When developing using the canonical workflow (`pnpm run pack` in plugins +
# `pnpm --filter @cio/db db:seed:plugins` in classroomio), no .env file is
# needed in this repository. Set `PLUGIN_ARTIFACTS_PATH` in `apps/api/.env`
# inside classroomio instead.
#
# The variables below are only needed if you use the standalone SDK CLI
# (`cio-plugin dev` or `cio-plugin seed`) to test an individual plugin:
CLASSROOMIO_API_URL=http://localhost:3002
CLASSROOMIO_DEV_TOKEN=
CLASSROOMIO_ORG_ID=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production Release Pipeline (GitHub Environment: plugin-production)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT add production credentials here. Configure these values in GitHub:
# Repository Settings -> Environments -> plugin-production.
# For full setup details, see .github/PRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# Secrets:
#   CLASSROOMIO_API_URL          Production ClassroomIO API URL (e.g. https://api.classroomio.com)
#   PLUGIN_RELEASE_DEPLOY_TOKEN  Token (min 32 chars) matching apps/api PLUGIN_RELEASE_DEPLOY_TOKEN
#   R2_ENDPOINT_URL              Cloudflare R2 endpoint (https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com)
#   R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID             R2 credentials scoped to the production plugin bucket
#   R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY         R2 secret key
#
# Variables:
#   PLUGIN_ASSET_BUCKET          R2 bucket name (e.g. classroomio-plugins)
